  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>As the juggler is throwing <em><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math></em> balls each second and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>nd</mi></msup></math> when the first is at its highest point, so the time taken by one ball to reach the highest point,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>.</p><p>And as at highest point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p>So, from first&nbsp;equation of motion,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Now in order to calculate height, using second equation of motion, we have:<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>S</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mtext>at</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></math> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ...(i)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext>g</mtext><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>So, the balls rise up to a height of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>.</p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
